    "Read the product and specs from the photo, priced at {price}. Sections: a kv (Product, Key specs found, Missing info to ask for), a table (Spec | Good / OK / Weak for the profile's uses | Why), bullets of 2 alternatives in the same price band, and a callout with buy / skip.",
